    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 16:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waxaan idin barayaa walaasheen Foybi oo ah mid u adeegta kiniisadda ku taal Kenekhreya, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.16.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.16.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 16:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "inaad iyada ku dhowaysaan Rabbiga, sida quduusiinta u eg, oo aad ku caawintaan wax kasta oo ay idiinka baahan tahay, waayo, iyaduba kuwa badan bay caawintay iyo xataa aniga qudhayda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.16.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.16.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 16:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.16.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.16.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 16:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Igu salaama Bariska iyo Akula kuwa iila shaqeeya Ciise Masiix, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.16.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.16.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 16:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "oo noloshayda aawadeed qoortooda u dhibay. Keligay uma mahad naqayo, laakiinse kiniisadaha dadka aan Yuhuudda ahayn oo dhammuna ay ku mahad naqayaan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.16.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.16.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 16:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iguna salaama kiniisadda gurigooda ku jirta. Igu salaama gacaliyahay Ebaynetos, kan ah midhaha ugu horreeya ee Aasiya xagga Masiixa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.16.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.16.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 16:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maryanna igu salaama, tan aad idiinku dadaashay. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.16.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.16.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 16:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Igu salaama Andaronikos iyo Yuniyas oo xigaalkayga ah oo layla xidhay, kuwa caanka ku ah rasuullada dhexdooda, kuwa hortayna Masiixa ku jiray. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.16.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.16.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 16:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ambaliyas, gacaliyahayga xagga Rabbigana igu salaama. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.16.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.16.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 16:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Urbanos kan Masiixa noola shaqeeya iyo gacaliyahay Istakhusna igu salaama. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.16.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.16.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 16:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abellees kan Masiixu u bogayna igu salaama. Kuwa reer Aristobulosna igu salaama. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.16.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.16.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 16:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Xigaalkay Herodiyosna igu salaama. Iguna salaama kuwa reer Narkisos oo Rabbiga ku jira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.16.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.16.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 16:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tarufayna iyo Tarufoosa oo Rabbiga u shaqeeyana igu salaama. Gacaliso Bersis oo Rabbiga aad ugu shaqaysayna igu salaama. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.16.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.16.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 16:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Igu salaama Rufus kan Rabbigu doortay iyo hooyadiis oo hooyaday oo kale ah. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.16.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.16.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 16:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Igu salaama Asunkiritos, iyo Filegoon, iyo Hermees, iyo Batrobas, iyo Hermaas, iyo walaalaha iyaga la jooga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.16.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.16.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 16:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Igu salaama Filologos, iyo Yulya, iyo Neere'us, iyo walaashiis, iyo Olumbas, iyo quduusiinta iyaga la jooga oo dhan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.16.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.16.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 16:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Midkiinba midka kale ha ku salaamo dhunkasho quduus ah. Kiniisadihii Masiixa oo dhammu waa idin soo salaamayaan.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.16.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.16.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 16:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.16.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.16.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 16:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haddaba walaalayaalow, waxaan idinka baryayaa inaad fiiro u lahaataan kuwa kicinaya iskala qaybinta iyo xumaatooyinka oo ka geesta ah cilmiga aad barateen, kana leexda iyaga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.16.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.16.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 16:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuwa caynkaas ahu Rabbigeenna Masiix uma adeegaan, laakiinse waxay u adeegaan calooshooda; hadalkooda macaan oo wanaagsan bay ku khiyaaneeyaan qalbiyada jaahiliinta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.16.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.16.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 16:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Warkii addeeciddiinnu wuxuu gaadhay dadka oo dhan. Sidaas daraaddeed aad baan idiinku faraxsanahay, laakiin waxaan jeclaan lahaa inaad garaad u lahaataan waxa wanaagsan, oo aad ka eedla'aataan waxa sharka ah. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.16.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.16.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 16:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo Ilaaha nabaddu Shaydaan buu haddiiba cagihiinna hoostooda ku burburin doonaa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.16.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.16.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 16:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nimcada Rabbigeenna Ciise Masiix ha idinla jirto.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.16.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.16.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 16:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.16.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.16.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 16:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waxaa idin soo salaamaya Timoteyos oo ila shaqeeya, iyo Lukiyos, iyo Yasoon, iyo Soosibater, iyagoo ah xigaalkayga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.16.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.16.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 16:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anigoo Tertiyos ah oo warqaddan qoray, Rabbigaan idinku salaamayaa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.16.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.16.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 16:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gayos, oo aniga iyo kiniisadda oo dhammuba aannu marti u nahay, wuu idin soo salaamayaa. Erastos oo ah qasnajiga magaalada, iyo walaalkeen Kowartos way idin soo salaamayaan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.16.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.16.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 16:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nimcada Rabbigeenna Ciise Masiix ha idinla jirto kulligiin. Aamiin.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.16.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.16.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ammaan",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 16:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.16.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.16.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 16:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haddaba ammaanu ha u ahaato kan kara inuu idinku xoogeeyo injiilkayga iyo wacdiga ku saabsan Ciise Masiix iyo muujinta qarsoodiga oo qarsoonaa tan iyo weligiis, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.16.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.16.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 16:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "laakiinse haatan lagu muujiyey Qorniinka nebiyada sida amarka Ilaaha daa'imka ah oo quruumaha oo dhan loo ogeysiiyey inay addeecaan rumaysadka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.16.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.16.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 16:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilaaha keligiis ah oo xigmadda leh, Ciise Masiix ammaanu ha ugu ahaato weligiis. Aamiin.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.16.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.16.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
